{"title":"Carapace Torso","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\">\n      <p class=\"wp-lede\">Crafted (Armor Smithing Lv 26) · Monster drop: Highwayman</p>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n      \n      <h2>How to get it</h2>\n      \n      \n      <p><b>Crafted</b> with Armor Smithing at level 26 <span class=\"muted\">(1395 XP)</span> from 8× <a href=\"#/item/silver-bar\">Silver Bar</a>, 2× <a href=\"#/item/scorpion-carapace\">Scorpion Carapace</a>.</p>\n      \n      \n      <div style=\"margin-top:10px\"><b>Recorded monster drops</b><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink\" data-monster=\"highwayman\" title=\"Highwayman - dropped it in 1 of 32 looted corpses (1/32)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/01bd8b56b2a034105292.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Highwayman</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/32<br>×1</span></div></div><div class=\"s muted\" style=\"margin-top:6px\">Drop rate as 1/X (about 1 kill in X drops it, counted over the corpses of each monster whose loot was recorded), and ×N, how many come in one drop.</div></div>\n      <button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"item\" data-map-id=\"carapace-torso\">Show where to get it on the map</button>\n      <p class=\"wp-guides\"><b>Guides:</b> <a href=\"#/guide/armor-smithing\">Armor smithing</a></p>\n      \n      \n      <h2>Related</h2><p class=\"rel-row\"><b>Made from</b> <a class=\"rel-chip\" href=\"#/item/silver-bar\"><img class=\"q-mini\" src=\"data/img/f78897e9b222ef2ef0f2.svg\" alt=\"\">Silver Bar</a><a class=\"rel-chip\" href=\"#/item/scorpion-carapace\"><img class=\"q-mini\" src=\"data/img/29de9072db7d3b475f5a.svg\" alt=\"\">Scorpion Carapace</a></p>\n      \n    </div><aside class=\"wp-infobox\"><div class=\"wp-pic \"><img src=\"data/img/gen/9e06ff78d9df94ecaa3a.svg\" alt=\"Carapace Torso\"></div><h3>Carapace Torso</h3><table>\n      \n      \n      \n      <tr><th>Made with</th><td>Armor Smithing 26</td>